    summary_60s: 'Drop your pen. Why did it fall down instead of up? Why not sideways? Why that exact speed? Physics answers the questions you stopped asking when you were five. It explains why the sky is blue, why you can\'t tickle yourself, why time moves slower when you\'re moving faster. This su',
