    subtopic: 'Hydrostatics',
    summary_60s: 'States of matter including solids, liquids and gases. Density and pressure in fluids. Change of phases. Archimedes’ principle and principle of floatation. Stoke’s law and terminal velocity. Bernoulli’s principle and Pitot-static tube principle. MATTER AND ITS PROPERTIES (Solids, ',
