    summary_60s: 'Rectilinear propagation of light. Laws of reflection and refraction. Reflection on plane and curved mirrors. Refraction at plane surfaces. Total internal reflection, critical angle and dispersion by prism. Rectilinear Propagation of Light In a uniform medium, light travels along ',
    key_formulas: '• Wave Speed Equation: v = f × λ\n• Period & Frequency: T = 1/f | f = 1/T\n• Snell\'s Law of Refraction: n = sin i / sin r = v₁ / v₂ = c / v\n• Critical Angle: sin c = 1/n\n• Lens Formula: 1/f = 1/u + 1/v | Magnification: m = v/u = h_i/h_o',
