    key_formulas: '• Ohm\'s Law: V = I × R\n• Electrical Power: P = IV = I²R = V²/R\n• Electrical Energy: E = P × t = IVt\n• Series Resistors: R_eq = R₁ + R₂ + R₃\n• Parallel Resistors: 1/R_eq = 1/R₁ + 1/R₂ ⇒ For two: R_eq = (R₁R₂) / (R₁ + R₂)',
