    key_formulas: '• 1st Equation: v = u + at\n• 2nd Equation: s = ut + ½at²\n• 3rd Equation: v² = u² + 2as\n• Average Velocity: v_avg = (u + v) / 2 = s / t\n• Under Gravity: Replace a with ±g (g = 9.8 or 10 m/s²)',
