    summary_60s: 'Magnetic Field Earth’s magnetic field and concept of magnetic field. Magnetic flux and flux density of solenoids, straight conductors and narrow circular coils. Earth’s Magnetic Field The Earth’s magnetic field , also called the geomagnetic field , is the magnetic field that surr',
